'' RUN: a 'byref as string' argument that is an ARRAY ELEMENT passes the element's own
'' descriptor. It is spelled as a call, and StrArgOwnDescriptor_ answered 'copy' for every
'' call, so 'modr( a( 1 ) )' wrote a temporary and a( 1 ) kept 'q' where fbc prints 'qX'.
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/strarg-element.bas -o tests/codegen/strargelem.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/strargelem.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: gX
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qX
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXX
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXXY
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXXYF
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXXYFF
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXXYFFX
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: qXXYFFXX
